        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.southernoregon.org/cities/yoncalla/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Early Oregon Trail settlers used Yoncalla as a vital stop during their westward migration.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
