      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.southernoregon.org/cities/yoncalla/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Settlers first arrived in the area that would become Yoncalla in covered wagons during the fall of 1848.",
